WEBVTT

00:14.700 --> 00:17.500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

00:17.540 --> 00:21.380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

00:21.980 --> 00:24.420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

00:24.500 --> 00:29.140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

00:30.540 --> 00:33.220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

00:33.540 --> 00:37.500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

00:37.860 --> 00:40.780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

00:41.620 --> 00:49.300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

00:49.900 --> 00:51.380
♪Together, they are known♪

00:52.060 --> 00:56.660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

01:25.660 --> 01:31.900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:32.060 --> 01:34.980
[Episode 7]
[This story is purely fictional]

01:35.310 --> 01:36.540
I clearly saw 15.

01:36.680 --> 01:37.410
These wool balls really...

01:42.590 --> 01:43.050
Forget it.

01:43.840 --> 01:45.050
You never believe a word I say.

01:49.430 --> 01:49.930
I believe you.

03:14.300 --> 03:16.820
♪I was raised♪

03:18.100 --> 03:21.580
♪Amid cast-off bones and alleyways...♪

03:25.030 --> 03:25.890
What is that thing?

03:28.240 --> 03:29.450
Catch it, and we'll find out.

03:31.360 --> 03:31.780
Fine.

03:32.910 --> 03:33.660
It's your turn now,

03:33.680 --> 03:34.380
Master Zhang.

03:35.680 --> 03:37.010
Show me what you've got.

03:39.460 --> 03:43.060
♪And weathered every storm♪

03:45.220 --> 03:49.100
♪Through another life, I look back once more♪

03:50.140 --> 03:54.420
♪But who can I tell?♪

03:56.620 --> 03:59.140
♪Beneath the iron curtain, the rain leaves me blind and deaf for now♪

03:59.140 --> 04:01.740
♪The child with a dog has nowhere to call home♪

04:01.740 --> 04:06.460
♪One vow between kindred souls makes death worthwhile♪

04:07.260 --> 04:09.740
♪How could comrades standing side by side let loyalty grow cold?♪

04:09.740 --> 04:12.380
♪I'll shatter bone and sinew to make the show go on♪

04:12.540 --> 04:14.500
♪Fight on, fight on♪

04:14.500 --> 04:21.540
♪Till Heaven's Gate lies trampled and broken...♪

04:33.480 --> 04:34.410
Notice anything?

04:34.750 --> 04:36.140
It's like a crow.

04:36.630 --> 04:37.490
It likes pretty things.

04:38.160 --> 04:39.250
It stops when it sees something shiny.

04:39.500 --> 04:42.020
♪I was raised♪

04:43.460 --> 04:45.860
♪Amid cast-off bones and alleyways...♪

04:45.870 --> 04:46.490
How annoying.

04:47.120 --> 04:48.340
Why does it keep coming after me?

04:50.240 --> 04:51.370
Maybe it likes your pretty face.

04:54.920 --> 04:55.460
How annoying.

04:56.190 --> 04:56.930
It has excellent taste.

05:00.860 --> 05:03.340
♪I've turned to dust♪

05:04.780 --> 05:08.380
♪And weathered every storm♪

05:10.540 --> 05:14.180
♪Through another life, I look back once more♪

05:15.460 --> 05:18.660
♪But who can I tell?♪

05:18.680 --> 05:19.850
So it likes pretty things, huh?

05:21.940 --> 05:24.580
♪You're not like him, so don't choose to perish...♪

05:25.800 --> 05:26.700
I'll trust you one more time.

05:28.240 --> 05:29.260
You'd better catch it.

05:29.260 --> 05:31.620
♪I'll overturn the way this world works♪

05:32.500 --> 05:35.220
♪I'm not like him, so don't be deceived♪

05:35.220 --> 05:37.860
♪Let half a crimson sun light my broken form♪

05:37.860 --> 05:39.860
♪All that burns♪

05:39.860 --> 05:48.020
♪Is a lone flame beneath the brooding clouds♪

06:03.070 --> 06:03.610
Not bad.

06:04.430 --> 06:05.810
Your skills are passable.

06:06.310 --> 06:07.140
Open your hand.

06:13.870 --> 06:14.610
Why did it vanish?

06:25.360 --> 06:26.100
Master Zhang,

06:26.630 --> 06:27.460
I have to say,

06:28.430 --> 06:29.730
couldn't you have been gentler?

06:31.190 --> 06:32.220
We finally caught one alive,

06:32.240 --> 06:33.460
and you made it vanish with one grab.

06:35.680 --> 06:36.660
What exactly was that thing?

06:37.190 --> 06:38.900
Probably one of the three imps in the mural.

06:43.830 --> 06:45.370
Next time, you try, Fifth Master.

06:45.430 --> 06:46.170
Show me how it's done.

06:46.800 --> 06:47.020
I...

06:48.950 --> 06:50.850
I only gave you the chance

06:51.310 --> 06:52.170
because you love showing off.

06:52.830 --> 06:54.170
Then thank you for the opportunity.

07:02.510 --> 07:03.340
You're welcome.

07:51.120 --> 07:52.460
Don't overthink it, Laogou.

07:52.800 --> 07:53.930
If you're sure, do it.

08:00.070 --> 08:01.460
Women in this world

08:02.750 --> 08:03.730
have it far harder than men.

08:04.920 --> 08:06.220
They're often forced to do

08:06.830 --> 08:08.020
the most menial, degrading work.

08:08.950 --> 08:10.340
You see the people's suffering

08:10.830 --> 08:11.660
very clearly, Laogou.

08:15.830 --> 08:16.700
I've simply seen too much.

08:17.560 --> 08:19.050
Once we get out of here,

08:19.920 --> 08:21.410
I'll see that you're duly rewarded.

08:23.240 --> 08:23.930
Duly rewarded?

08:29.190 --> 08:30.220
The position of Changsha Defense Commander.

08:31.390 --> 08:32.300
You take Mondays, Wednesdays, and Fridays.

08:33.600 --> 08:34.610
I'll take Tuesdays, Thursdays, and Saturdays.

08:35.360 --> 08:35.730
How about that?

08:38.200 --> 08:38.700
Agreed.

09:10.870 --> 09:12.980
The son ends up a beggar

09:13.840 --> 09:15.370
and works Madam Wang to death.

09:18.510 --> 09:20.300
What nonsense, "Madam Wang's Lecture."

09:20.790 --> 09:22.850
The son should decide his own fate.

09:23.390 --> 09:24.700
Why should Madam Wang bear the burden?

09:25.630 --> 09:26.530
What kind of world is this?

09:28.910 --> 09:30.490
We may not be able to change the world,

09:31.720 --> 09:33.180
but I hope that one day,

09:34.360 --> 09:36.010
we'll all be masters of our own fate.

09:38.270 --> 09:39.610
I hope so.

09:48.270 --> 09:49.180
You're playing the bait next.

10:10.240 --> 10:12.420
Careful. There may be a new punishment.

10:16.510 --> 10:17.340
Come on,

10:18.390 --> 10:19.490
you little imps.

11:07.320 --> 11:08.100
Come and get me!

11:13.510 --> 11:13.940
Good.

11:15.480 --> 11:16.610
The imps are gone,

11:17.390 --> 11:18.370
and the mechanism is disabled.

11:19.360 --> 11:20.370
Let's take a break.

11:21.240 --> 11:23.100
You rest. I'll keep looking.

12:02.210 --> 12:02.680
Whoa.

12:03.960 --> 12:05.460
It vanished into thin air.

12:06.630 --> 12:07.700
And it was a new one.

12:09.120 --> 12:10.530
And it was skinny.

12:13.790 --> 12:14.580
It was this thin.

12:16.360 --> 12:17.370
Was it rolled out

12:18.080 --> 12:19.370
like a noodle in its last life?

12:22.390 --> 12:23.490
Where did this one come from?

12:24.270 --> 12:25.580
Probably another one from the mural.

12:30.200 --> 12:31.010
This thing

12:32.550 --> 12:33.700
can crawl into people.

12:36.270 --> 12:38.420
Did you see where it went?

12:38.910 --> 12:39.490
No.

12:41.870 --> 12:42.580
Let's check one by one.

12:53.030 --> 12:53.850
You scared me.

12:54.550 --> 12:55.730
We don't know what we're dealing with.

12:56.670 --> 12:57.580
We shouldn't split up.

12:58.270 --> 12:58.940
Stay close.

13:19.630 --> 13:20.340
Are you hungry?

13:38.840 --> 13:39.730
That smells delicious.

13:50.510 --> 13:50.940
Laogou.

13:59.270 --> 14:00.580
Did you find the skinny imp?

14:01.630 --> 14:02.180
No.

14:03.270 --> 14:04.300
Then why call my name?

14:05.720 --> 14:06.610
Keep looking.

14:11.120 --> 14:12.700
Something's wrong with you.

14:13.480 --> 14:14.340
Just keep looking.

14:15.670 --> 14:16.460
I'm perfectly fine.

14:21.030 --> 14:21.370
Laogou!

14:34.510 --> 14:35.100
Zhang Qishan,

14:37.080 --> 14:37.730
I think...

14:38.480 --> 14:39.060
I think...

14:47.790 --> 14:48.530
I'm all right.

14:48.870 --> 14:49.370
Zhang Qishan...

14:49.510 --> 14:49.980
Don't move!

14:56.440 --> 14:56.980
It's...

14:58.120 --> 14:58.730
I'm starving.

15:00.510 --> 15:02.610
Thank goodness.

15:02.910 --> 15:03.890
Better Zhang Qishan than me.

15:11.360 --> 15:11.940
I see.

15:12.840 --> 15:13.490
This thing

15:14.320 --> 15:16.010
can only possess one person at a time.

15:24.320 --> 15:25.100
I'm starving.

15:25.600 --> 15:26.770
Is this a hungry imp?

15:31.480 --> 15:33.130
When will it be your turn?

15:34.030 --> 15:34.700
I don't know.

15:35.440 --> 15:36.220
I can't eat any more.

15:36.600 --> 15:37.300
I can't eat any more.

15:52.030 --> 15:52.940
Hungry imp, switch hosts!

15:53.510 --> 15:54.460
Switch hosts!

15:55.750 --> 15:56.650
Switch hosts!

15:58.550 --> 16:00.470
Switch hosts!

16:12.510 --> 16:13.650
This is infuriating!

16:19.000 --> 16:20.460
Miss Huo, you call the shots.

16:21.030 --> 16:22.220
We'll do whatever you say.

16:33.360 --> 16:33.940
I don't know,

16:35.510 --> 16:37.300
but no one could be inside that hole.

16:38.670 --> 16:39.820
The gap inside is tiny.

16:40.200 --> 16:41.490
No person could possibly fit.

16:41.840 --> 16:42.980
Even if someone got in,

16:44.030 --> 16:45.890
they would've been crushed beyond recognition.

16:46.240 --> 16:47.340
They couldn't possibly be alive.

16:48.870 --> 16:50.250
Miss Huo is on their side.

16:50.750 --> 16:51.890
Bring out all the explosives.

16:52.200 --> 16:53.100
We'll blast open the ceiling.

16:53.150 --> 16:53.730
- Yes. - Stop.

16:54.870 --> 16:55.940
Didn't you say you'd listen to me?

16:56.480 --> 16:57.250
If the ceiling collapses,

16:57.550 --> 16:59.180
we'll all be buried in here.

17:01.870 --> 17:02.460
Juanlian.

17:02.630 --> 17:03.100
Juanlian.

17:07.790 --> 17:09.220
Are you trying to get Fifth Master killed?

17:09.790 --> 17:10.530
Give me the explosives.

17:11.590 --> 17:11.980
Tiezui.

17:14.110 --> 17:14.980
Take everyone

17:15.310 --> 17:16.700
somewhere safe and find cover.

17:17.000 --> 17:18.140
I'll handle the blast. It's safer.

17:18.160 --> 17:19.980
Wait, Xiangu, you... I...

17:21.640 --> 17:22.810
Fine.

18:15.720 --> 18:17.330
Master!

18:17.680 --> 18:18.220
Master!

18:19.550 --> 18:20.140
Master!

18:22.070 --> 18:23.770
Juanlian, it's a dead end.

18:24.160 --> 18:25.250
Did the blast send Master flying?

18:25.550 --> 18:26.860
Why didn't you say so earlier?

18:27.000 --> 18:28.290
I thought once he heard us preparing the blast,

18:28.310 --> 18:29.330
he'd get out of the way.

18:29.550 --> 18:30.460
It's sealed off above.

18:31.000 --> 18:33.330
But when you lit the fuses earlier, the smoke moved.

18:34.200 --> 18:35.330
There must be a mechanism up there.

18:35.510 --> 18:37.900
A narrow gap traps heat.

18:38.830 --> 18:39.660
The temperatures inside and outside differed,

18:39.960 --> 18:41.090
so the smoke naturally drifted toward it.

18:41.920 --> 18:42.980
Are you happy now?

18:47.750 --> 18:49.420
But we all saw that hand.

18:49.750 --> 18:50.660
Even if it wasn't Fifth Master's,

18:50.920 --> 18:52.050
there must be some explanation.

18:53.680 --> 18:54.810
Could there really be a ghost?

18:57.480 --> 18:58.770
Enough. Stop making wild guesses.

19:00.590 --> 19:01.770
This tower must have lured us here

19:02.310 --> 19:03.420
for some other purpose.

19:05.640 --> 19:06.810
What do you suggest we do, Eighth Master?

19:07.790 --> 19:08.620
Three words.

19:08.920 --> 19:09.490
Stick together.

19:10.110 --> 19:11.090
Isn't that two words?

19:11.480 --> 19:12.900
Master Zhang and Fifth Master aren't here,

19:13.440 --> 19:14.660
so we have to hold the line for them.

19:15.000 --> 19:16.380
We can't let this tower have its way.

19:23.790 --> 19:24.490
Zhang Qishan,

19:25.200 --> 19:26.220
I kept something from you.

19:27.000 --> 19:28.330
There were two characters on that red ball.

19:29.160 --> 19:30.310
I may not be able to read,

19:30.680 --> 19:32.050
but I recognized the shape.

19:32.550 --> 19:33.780
It should be "Peng Ju."

19:35.960 --> 19:37.390
Have you heard of the Three Worms?

19:39.000 --> 19:39.670
A folk healer

19:40.790 --> 19:42.400
once told me

19:43.560 --> 19:46.810
that everyone is born with three parasites inside.

19:48.190 --> 19:49.700
To live a long life,

19:51.350 --> 19:52.850
you have to kill all three.

19:53.480 --> 19:54.500
The Three Worms are

19:54.910 --> 19:55.740
Peng Ju,

19:56.190 --> 19:56.980
Peng Zhi,

19:57.670 --> 19:58.500
and Peng Qiao.

19:59.560 --> 20:00.570
Peng Ju is drawn to beauty

20:01.640 --> 20:02.690
and lavish finery.

20:03.250 --> 20:04.370
It dwells in the head.

20:04.920 --> 20:05.780
Peng Zhi

20:06.190 --> 20:07.090
craves delicacies

20:07.590 --> 20:08.570
and dwells in the belly.

20:09.150 --> 20:09.890
Peng Qiao

20:11.590 --> 20:12.700
dwells in the dantian

20:13.910 --> 20:15.170
and stirs up the heart-fire.

20:22.350 --> 20:23.780
The three imps in the mural

20:24.170 --> 20:25.940
are the Three Worms within the great ghost.

20:26.830 --> 20:28.890
That red ball was Peng Ju.

20:29.630 --> 20:32.650
The hungry imp haunting us now

20:33.760 --> 20:34.500
is Peng Zhi.

20:35.720 --> 20:36.940
If Peng Ju can be killed,

20:37.430 --> 20:38.740
then Peng Zhi can be killed too.

20:45.420 --> 20:46.260
Zhang Qishan,

20:47.650 --> 20:49.650
hurry up and find a way to kill it,

20:50.910 --> 20:52.810
or I might really eat you.

20:56.240 --> 20:57.220
Where are you going?

20:58.070 --> 20:58.810
I'm fishing it out.

20:59.310 --> 21:01.860
I'll lure Peng Zhi out of your belly.

21:02.200 --> 21:03.330
Could you hurry?

21:10.110 --> 21:10.900
Zhang Qishan,

21:12.000 --> 21:13.330
do you have anything else to eat?

21:16.270 --> 21:16.730
Yes.

21:25.110 --> 21:25.860
What are you doing?

21:26.200 --> 21:27.050
Desperate times.

21:27.960 --> 21:28.570
You'll have to make do.

21:45.000 --> 21:45.490
Come on.

21:54.510 --> 21:55.090
Wait!

22:01.640 --> 22:02.460
This is revolting.

22:09.480 --> 22:10.330
Master Zhang,

22:11.350 --> 22:12.900
it's finally your turn.

22:30.000 --> 22:30.620
Zhang Qishan,

22:31.680 --> 22:32.530
tell me,

22:33.790 --> 22:35.490
if I stab it now,

22:37.200 --> 22:38.380
will you die too?

22:40.270 --> 22:41.290
I don't know about it,

22:42.200 --> 22:43.570
but I certainly will.

22:48.240 --> 22:49.490
Then make do with this.

23:05.270 --> 23:06.180
You'd really eat that?

23:06.680 --> 23:07.860
Stop playing around,

23:09.070 --> 23:10.940
or I'll eat you too.

23:13.920 --> 23:14.380
Fine.

23:16.240 --> 23:17.490
You said it yourself.

23:18.550 --> 23:19.420
I'll lure it out for you.

23:21.000 --> 23:21.620
Brace yourself.

23:48.830 --> 23:49.570
This thing

23:50.310 --> 23:52.180
can jump between us in an instant.

23:56.030 --> 23:56.660
I think...

23:59.240 --> 24:01.220
Better Zhang Qishan than me.

24:04.160 --> 24:04.810
Wait!

24:08.510 --> 24:09.180
It's the eyes.

24:09.880 --> 24:11.330
It moves back and forth through eye contact.

24:13.310 --> 24:14.700
So even if we lure it out,

24:15.590 --> 24:16.940
it'll just possess one of us again.

24:17.640 --> 24:19.290
Then wasn't that whole plan useless?

24:19.750 --> 24:20.330
What do we do?

24:26.510 --> 24:28.330
Since it came from the mechanism,

24:29.200 --> 24:30.420
we'll disable the mechanism.

24:31.920 --> 24:32.810
What if the imp

24:33.310 --> 24:34.980
still won't leave after we disable it?

24:35.550 --> 24:37.530
Then we'll find a way to kill it.

24:38.830 --> 24:39.420
Wait.

24:40.510 --> 24:41.530
What if we disable it

24:42.110 --> 24:43.810
and another imp appears?

24:44.880 --> 24:45.810
Then you can eat it.

24:46.790 --> 24:47.730
But the next imp

24:49.200 --> 24:50.240
is Peng Qiao.

24:52.750 --> 24:53.860
It stirs up the heart-fire.

24:59.070 --> 25:01.230
Zhang Qishan, you'd better hurry.

25:02.000 --> 25:02.980
I'm starving to death!

25:10.400 --> 25:12.180
A play often moves people

25:12.960 --> 25:14.330
in a single moment.

25:15.830 --> 25:16.700
The same goes for mechanisms.

25:18.160 --> 25:19.180
They may look complicated,

25:20.110 --> 25:22.290
but it's all misdirection.

25:23.590 --> 25:25.140
We need to simplify it.

25:45.750 --> 25:46.660
Bravo!

25:52.160 --> 25:53.620
I know how to solve it.

26:42.720 --> 26:43.330
Still hungry?

26:56.350 --> 26:57.180
Did you disable the mechanism?

26:58.400 --> 26:58.770
Yes.

27:12.750 --> 27:14.050
That wretched Peng Zhi.

27:14.640 --> 27:15.770
If I ever see you again,

27:16.310 --> 27:17.570
I'll starve you

27:18.160 --> 27:19.140
into a chopstick imp!

27:22.440 --> 27:23.530
Didn't you say you weren't hungry?

27:26.160 --> 27:27.180
What?

27:28.200 --> 27:29.290
After all we've been through,

27:30.070 --> 27:31.010
aren't you hungry too?

27:34.550 --> 27:35.570
Untie me!

27:54.110 --> 27:55.490
The son becomes the top scholar,

27:56.720 --> 27:58.380
and Madam Wang can finally live in comfort.

28:01.960 --> 28:03.330
Surely we got it right this time, right?

28:19.070 --> 28:20.010
Of the creatures on that relief,

28:20.750 --> 28:21.620
we've encountered

28:22.550 --> 28:24.050
the giant serpent, Peng Ju, and Peng Zhi.

28:26.030 --> 28:27.420
So beyond this passage lies

28:28.640 --> 28:29.290
the great ghost.

28:59.270 --> 28:59.860
Xiangu,

29:00.830 --> 29:02.610
I know you're worried about Laogou.

29:03.510 --> 29:04.160
With him gone,

29:05.240 --> 29:06.730
you must feel unsettled.

29:08.030 --> 29:10.500
You can't hide it from me.

29:11.590 --> 29:14.420
I once read a book called "Strange Tales of Penglai".

29:14.920 --> 29:16.110
It said

29:19.750 --> 29:22.290
that feelings like yours and Laogou's...

29:24.070 --> 29:25.140
At a time like this,

29:26.440 --> 29:27.900
instead of worrying about everyone's safety,

29:28.400 --> 29:29.180
you're talking about that?

29:31.240 --> 29:32.380
I'm the Eighth Master.

29:33.070 --> 29:34.180
I keep all eight sides covered

29:34.510 --> 29:35.810
and concern myself with everything.

29:37.000 --> 29:38.350
What did the book say?

29:40.750 --> 29:43.940
"A lone goose flies east, with a corner to the west.

29:44.550 --> 29:46.250
Eastward, it may arrive.

29:46.720 --> 29:49.330
A lone goose flies west, with a corner to the west.

29:50.030 --> 29:51.420
Westward, it cannot arrive."

29:52.110 --> 29:52.810
What does that mean?

29:53.720 --> 29:54.880
The book has been lost.

29:55.030 --> 29:56.700
I was only teasing you.

29:56.750 --> 29:59.900
That line can't be deciphered.

30:07.750 --> 30:08.780
That's Tu.

30:09.310 --> 30:10.860
Juanlian, that's Tu!

30:25.400 --> 30:27.290
Madam Huo, Eighth Master, a picture from Fifth Master!

30:31.030 --> 30:31.860
Fifth Master says

30:32.550 --> 30:34.250
the place they've reached looks like the Underworld.

30:35.750 --> 30:37.250
If his picture reaches us,

30:37.570 --> 30:38.490
the two places

30:38.720 --> 30:39.620
must be linked by a mechanism.

30:40.310 --> 30:40.810
Keep looking.

30:41.160 --> 30:41.770
If we can't find a way,

30:41.960 --> 30:43.180
Eighth Master can perform another ritual

30:43.510 --> 30:44.250
and send us all over there.

30:44.480 --> 30:44.980
Eighth Master,

30:46.240 --> 30:47.330
please begin at once.

32:50.680 --> 32:51.530
This place doesn't look

32:51.880 --> 32:53.600
like the great ghost is here.

32:58.110 --> 32:59.660
What could be inside these vats?

33:01.680 --> 33:02.510
Don't touch them.

33:05.160 --> 33:06.120
The lids

33:06.400 --> 33:07.290
bear Daoist symbols.

33:09.090 --> 33:10.900
They seem to be suppressing something.

33:13.830 --> 33:14.730
Zhang Qishan,

33:15.680 --> 33:17.060
don't tell me you're afraid.

33:19.440 --> 33:20.250
Then open one.

33:21.750 --> 33:22.900
I should be able to protect you.

33:24.830 --> 33:25.770
I think

33:26.200 --> 33:27.460
we should understand the situation

33:28.160 --> 33:29.330
before deciding what to do.

33:56.400 --> 33:56.980
What's written there?

34:05.160 --> 34:06.140
They seem to be notes

34:07.240 --> 34:08.260
on herbs and alchemy.

34:11.320 --> 34:12.900
They may have been studying magic.

34:13.400 --> 34:14.340
Magic?

34:20.920 --> 34:22.860
Why would that require so many vats?

34:25.030 --> 34:26.820
Could they all be filled with magic pills?

34:29.550 --> 34:30.280
But there isn't

34:30.280 --> 34:32.020
a single alchemy furnace in this room.

34:32.760 --> 34:34.390
They could be the alchemists' test subjects.

34:42.510 --> 34:44.380
Looks like another dead end.

34:55.800 --> 34:58.690
Why is there hair on this mural?

35:23.510 --> 35:24.980
All this hair has rotted away.

35:44.510 --> 35:45.010
Laogou!

35:52.800 --> 35:53.340
In this place,

35:54.230 --> 35:56.380
alchemists experimented on people and animals.

35:57.110 --> 35:58.820
The vats contain people and animals of all kinds.

36:07.320 --> 36:08.420
So that's what happened.

36:10.480 --> 36:11.690
The alchemists fed their pills

36:12.280 --> 36:13.260
to people and animals,

36:14.320 --> 36:15.570
causing them to mutate.

36:15.590 --> 36:16.740
This place is a prison.

36:18.000 --> 36:19.820
They locked all their mutated creations

36:21.840 --> 36:22.940
inside these vats.

36:24.960 --> 36:25.610
Were all these monsters

36:25.840 --> 36:27.340
created by the Otherworld Patriarch?

36:27.800 --> 36:28.690
If he was so powerful,

36:29.000 --> 36:30.010
why did he need to be a fraud?

36:31.590 --> 36:32.050
No.

36:32.710 --> 36:33.530
The things here

36:34.230 --> 36:35.130
are clearly much older.

36:36.550 --> 36:37.090
I understand now.

36:39.360 --> 36:40.780
When the Otherworld Patriarch built the tower,

36:40.790 --> 36:41.560
he uncovered this place

36:43.110 --> 36:45.490
and linked it to the tower through mechanisms.

36:47.230 --> 36:48.840
He also wanted to use these monsters

36:49.760 --> 36:51.760
to make his followers believe he had magic powers.

36:52.110 --> 36:54.850
But his plan failed, and the monsters escaped.

36:55.550 --> 36:56.990
So he had to abandon the Otherworld Tower.

36:57.400 --> 36:58.820
Now we have to deal with what he unleashed.

37:00.190 --> 37:01.340
Can we even handle them?

37:02.230 --> 37:03.980
That shadow alone had us running in circles.

37:04.960 --> 37:05.980
Even the darkest evil

37:06.310 --> 37:07.290
follows a pattern.

37:08.040 --> 37:09.460
Once we see the pattern,

37:09.790 --> 37:10.770
it won't be hard to handle.

37:12.840 --> 37:13.730
We've come all this way

37:14.040 --> 37:15.060
without finding a single clue.

37:15.920 --> 37:16.570
But perhaps

37:16.590 --> 37:18.020
the key clue already appeared,

37:18.750 --> 37:19.900
and we simply overlooked it.

37:36.880 --> 37:38.170
Zhang Qishan, come with me.

37:45.960 --> 37:46.770
Look at this.

37:47.150 --> 37:48.060
Could this be what we missed?

37:59.790 --> 38:00.290
Zhang Qishan,

38:00.360 --> 38:01.500
what do you think it means that a man

38:02.400 --> 38:03.170
was hidden beneath this hair?

38:04.710 --> 38:05.340
I don't know.

38:06.040 --> 38:08.090
But he outranks even the great Underworld King.

38:09.000 --> 38:11.130
Is this mural identical

38:11.750 --> 38:12.900
to the relief outside?

38:16.840 --> 38:17.380
No.

38:18.840 --> 38:20.290
This man isn't on the relief.

38:21.040 --> 38:22.340
There, the great ghost rides the serpent.

38:22.840 --> 38:23.540
But in this mural,

38:24.110 --> 38:25.500
it has swallowed the serpent into its body.

38:26.190 --> 38:26.900
What does that mean?

38:29.080 --> 38:29.500
Look.

38:30.400 --> 38:31.130
The man above

38:31.310 --> 38:32.250
is the true master of this place.

38:33.000 --> 38:34.650
Don't think of the great ghost as a ghost.

38:35.920 --> 38:36.900
Think of it as a map.

38:38.110 --> 38:39.770
The ghost's head beneath its master is one room.

38:40.440 --> 38:42.340
The serpent in its belly is another.

38:43.630 --> 38:45.130
What place does the map formed by this great ghost

38:46.480 --> 38:47.020
represent?

38:49.400 --> 38:50.900
The Otherworld Tower itself.

39:09.060 --> 39:09.930
In the zaju version of "Journey to the West,"

39:09.930 --> 39:10.780
there's a scene

39:11.190 --> 39:12.530
where Sun Wukong alters the Book of Life and Death.

39:13.190 --> 39:13.940
He passes Pingdu Mountain

39:13.960 --> 39:14.940
in the Underworld

39:15.510 --> 39:16.380
and meets an immortal

39:17.150 --> 39:18.530
wearing an exceptionally tall hat.

39:19.760 --> 39:21.820
The immortal's abode is built upon a great ghost.

39:23.110 --> 39:23.900
His name is...

39:26.400 --> 39:27.090
Yin Changsheng.

39:29.320 --> 39:29.780
Look.

39:31.630 --> 39:32.690
That's Yin Changsheng.

39:40.960 --> 39:41.690
I understand now.

39:42.480 --> 39:43.370
The master of this place

39:44.480 --> 39:45.460
is Yin Changsheng.

39:46.590 --> 39:47.980
He practiced alchemy and mystic arts here,

39:48.480 --> 39:49.650
then imprisoned all the monsters

39:50.110 --> 39:51.170
he created through his arts.

39:52.400 --> 39:52.820
Yes.

39:53.230 --> 39:53.860
That's it.

39:54.550 --> 39:55.210
Yin Changsheng

39:55.800 --> 39:57.740
knows tricks that can manipulate

39:58.230 --> 39:59.260
and reverse time,

40:00.030 --> 40:01.490
and make the sun set in the east and rise in the west.

40:02.880 --> 40:04.380
Every detail along our way makes sense now.

40:05.190 --> 40:06.130
Tiezui once said

40:07.110 --> 40:08.340
these were the divine powers

40:08.670 --> 40:10.090
the Otherworld Patriarch claimed to possess.

40:11.030 --> 40:12.650
Now it seems

40:12.920 --> 40:13.900
all his deceptions

40:14.440 --> 40:15.340
began only after he

40:15.590 --> 40:16.690
broke through into this place.

40:17.630 --> 40:19.050
This was where he found his inspiration.

40:19.480 --> 40:20.400
Perhaps they weren't deceptions.

40:21.280 --> 40:21.980
The Otherworld Patriarch

40:22.400 --> 40:23.430
may truly have believed

40:23.430 --> 40:24.340
these feats could be achieved.

40:24.880 --> 40:26.460
So after he found this place,

40:27.360 --> 40:28.490
he genuinely tried to learn them.

40:30.880 --> 40:32.260
To learn Yin Changsheng's methods.

40:34.670 --> 40:35.210
Exactly.

40:38.760 --> 40:40.420
He found a way into this place,

40:41.110 --> 40:42.170
but he never expected

40:43.030 --> 40:44.010
that once he entered,

40:44.510 --> 40:45.090
he would find it

40:45.110 --> 40:46.440
filled with monsters created by Yin.

40:47.510 --> 40:48.420
He got the methods wrong,

40:49.510 --> 40:50.980
and his followers paid the price.

40:51.550 --> 40:52.420
It ended in tragedy.

40:53.280 --> 40:53.820
As for him,

40:54.630 --> 40:55.340
he could only flee.

40:56.510 --> 40:57.380
Once outside,

40:57.760 --> 40:58.650
he built high walls,

40:58.960 --> 40:59.860
hoping to keep every monster

41:00.320 --> 41:01.460
trapped inside the Otherworld Tower.

41:01.670 --> 41:02.300
That's impossible.

41:03.400 --> 41:04.920
It makes sense,

41:05.150 --> 41:07.210
but there must be more to it.

41:09.030 --> 41:09.690
What about the shadow?

41:10.320 --> 41:11.570
How do you explain that?

41:13.320 --> 41:14.530
If I were writing this play,

41:15.320 --> 41:16.170
the shadow would be this man,

41:16.960 --> 41:17.860
Yin Changsheng himself.

41:20.880 --> 41:22.340
He probably took one of his own pills

41:23.110 --> 41:24.650
and became neither human nor ghost.

41:29.000 --> 41:29.980
Quite a show

41:30.510 --> 41:31.610
has unfolded in this tower.

41:54.660 --> 41:57.260
[Yin Changsheng]

42:14.540 --> 42:18.700
♪The past fades like smoke♪

42:19.060 --> 42:21.780
♪A choice is made in silence♪

42:22.060 --> 42:24.860
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

42:25.260 --> 42:29.020
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

42:29.260 --> 42:32.700
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

42:32.980 --> 42:36.380
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

42:36.460 --> 42:43.740
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

42:44.180 --> 42:47.460
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

42:47.740 --> 42:50.980
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

42:51.140 --> 42:55.180
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

42:55.380 --> 42:58.740
♪Who believes in fate?♪

42:58.980 --> 43:02.340
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

43:02.580 --> 43:05.860
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

43:06.180 --> 43:09.860
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

43:10.060 --> 43:13.300
♪Take care♪

43:13.300 --> 43:15.860
♪We once raced♪

43:15.940 --> 43:17.860
♪For the dawn♪

43:18.020 --> 43:21.300
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

43:21.420 --> 43:24.700
♪In the web of fate♪

43:24.700 --> 43:27.900
♪No one can escape♪

43:28.900 --> 43:30.740
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

43:30.900 --> 43:32.460
♪We too were young once♪

43:32.540 --> 43:35.980
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

43:36.180 --> 43:38.500
♪Keep the ember lit♪

43:38.620 --> 43:43.140
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

43:43.260 --> 43:46.220
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

43:46.460 --> 43:49.980
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

43:50.100 --> 43:53.860
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

43:54.180 --> 43:57.660
♪Who believes in fate?♪

43:57.820 --> 44:00.820
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

44:01.060 --> 44:04.820
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

44:04.980 --> 44:08.700
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

44:08.820 --> 44:20.260
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
